"Claude Code saves a login that lasts a few hours, and only Claude Code can renew it. It also reports your limits to whatever status line command is registered — Pulse can be that command, and then it keeps working whether the login is fresh or not.\n\nThis edits ~/.claude/settings.json and changes the status line at the bottom of your Claude Code sessions. Any status line you already have keeps working, and you can disconnect it in Settings." = "Claude Code 存的登录只有几小时有效，而且只有它自己能续期。它同时会把额度报给已注册的状态栏命令——Pulse 可以当这个命令，那样无论登录是否新鲜都读得到。\n\n这会改写 ~/.claude/settings.json，并改变你 Claude Code 会话底部那行状态栏。你原有的状态栏仍然照常工作，随时可以在设置里断开。";
