/* 火山引擎方舟 */
"Install arkcli and run `arkcli auth login`, or add access keys in Settings." = "请安装 arkcli 并执行 `arkcli auth login`，或在设置里填入访问密钥。";
"arkcli isn't signed in. Run `arkcli auth login`." = "arkcli 还没登录。执行 `arkcli auth login`。";
"Signs Volcengine's usage API with the access keys you entered." = "用你填的访问密钥签名调用火山引擎的用量接口。";
"Asks arkcli, using the login it already saved." = "调用 arkcli，用它已经保存的登录。";
"Access keys" = "访问密钥";
"AccessKeyID:SecretAccessKey, from Volcengine. Optional — arkcli needs none. Stored encrypted on this Mac." = "格式为 AccessKeyID:SecretAccessKey，来自火山引擎。可不填——走 arkcli 不需要。加密保存在本机。";
"Antigravity is open but didn't answer. Restarting it usually helps." = "Antigravity 开着但没有响应，重启它通常能解决。";

/* 内圈第二条限额 */
"Second limit inside the ring" = "显示第二条限额";
"A thinner ring for the next-fullest limit, where a provider has one." = "在圆环内侧显示第二条限额，仅当服务商提供多条时可用。";
"That key works. The account has no Coding Plan running on it." = "密钥是有效的，这个账号名下没有生效中的 Coding Plan。";

/* 来自服务商官方统计的用量历史 */
"Reported by %@ for the whole account, so it covers every machine you use it on. It counts tokens only — the figures behind it cannot be turned into a cost." = "由 %@ 按账号统计，涵盖你使用它的所有设备。仅统计 token 数量——所依据的数据无法折算成金额。";
"This account hasn't used anything yet, so there is nothing to chart." = "这个账号还没有产生用量，暂时没有可统计的记录。";
"Asking %@" = "正在向 %@ 查询";
"Last 7 days" = "最近 7 天";

/* 按模型分组拆分环 */
"A ring for each model group" = "按模型分组显示";
"Gemini and the third-party models draw on separate allowances. One ring can only follow the busier of the two." = "Gemini 与第三方模型的额度相互独立，一个环只能跟随用得多的那一边。";
"%@ didn't answer, so there is nothing to chart yet. Try again in a moment." = "%@ 没有返回数据，暂时无法绘制。请稍后重试。";
"Add a key above and Pulse can read this account's history." = "在上方填入密钥，即可读取该账号的用量历史。";
"This account is switched off, so Pulse hasn't asked for its history." = "该账号已关闭，Pulse 没有去读取它的用量历史。";
